{"repositoryId":1354380557,"availability":"available","full":"MrigankJaiswal-hub/AeroCorridor-Rakshak","name":"AeroCorridor-Rakshak","description":"Cooperative 5G O-RAN and edge-AI platform that predicts wildlife–vehicle conflicts, orchestrates herd-safe road crossings and verifies safety outcomes.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-02T06:02:34Z","updated":"2026-09-04T06:22:15Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aerocorridor-rakshak.streamlit.app/ ","topics":["5g","collision-prevention","computer-vision","digital-twin","edge-ai","fastapi","open-ran","oran","road-safety","smart-infrastructure","streamlit","wildlife-safety","yolo"],"demo":"https://aerocorridor-rakshak.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T18:15:38.559Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T18:15:38.559Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T18:15:38.559Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T09:46:43.295Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T18:15:38.559Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["5G O-RAN–Enabled Predictive Wildlife Collision Prevention for Forest Roads","Detect early. Predict risk. Prevent collisions.","AeroCorridor Rakshak is an algorithm-level proof of concept for preventing human–animal collisions on remote forest roads. It combines emulated multimodal roadside sensing, transparent trajectory-risk calculations, local fail-safe decisions, dynamic driver warnings, a corridor digital twin, and a policy mock-up for a proposed near-RT RIC xApp."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MrigankJaiswal-hub/AeroCorridor-Rakshak/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"eaea1185f17b4e287ed7a9f61ad3029e0490c64b16d989f08c9d236d88a28096","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:43.728Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:43.728Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"5G O-RAN–Enabled Predictive Wildlife Collision Prevention for Forest Roads","sourc